# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo AND in every working tree,
# regardless of the machine's core.autocrlf setting. Biome enforces
# `formatter.lineEnding: "lf"` (biome.json), so CRLF checkouts fail `pnpm lint`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (never normalized or diffed as text)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
